{%- comment -%}
  TALLOW ADVERTORIAL - B30C4, 2026-07-19.
  Distinct file from tallow-advertorial.liquid (the killed B24/B25 destination),
  kept separate on purpose so B24's history stays intact and isn't silently
  overwritten. This page's body copy matches B30C1's self-recognition +
  villain-reversal ad verbatim in voice/characters (Renata, Priya, Dana), it
  is NOT a generic mechanism page, it's the specific narrative continuation
  of B30C1/C4's ad copy, condensed, so a reader who clicked from that exact ad
  doesn't lose the narrator's voice at the click the way a generic PDP would.

  ISOLATION RULE, do not violate: this page's copy must stay locked to
  B30C1/C4's story. If B30C1's ad copy changes, update this page to match,
  do not let them drift, drift here reintroduces the exact confound that
  sank B24/B25 (unproven creative on an unproven destination at the same time).

  Assign via page template page.advertorial-b30.json. CTA -> PDP.

  Compliance posture, unchanged from the account standard: first-person story,
  same narrator persona used across the ad account (Julie). NO fabricated view
  counts, NO fake doctor quotes, NO invented testimonials, the review slot
  stays empty until a REAL customer quote is confirmed (per house policy, do
  not fill this in without a real Judge.me quote). Disclosure footer required.
{%- endcomment -%}

